		<Formel></Formel>
		<SystemName>-</SystemName>
		<Name>
			<Text TI="">Code for compressor off</Text>
		</Name>
		<diskreterSW xml:space="preserve">0 ... 19</diskreterSW>
		<analogerSWunten></analogerSWunten>
		<analogerSWoben></analogerSWoben>
		<SWE></SWE>
		<SWF>T</SWF>
		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\NY\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\K\N \L\S\G\A\INote:\L\S\K\N

0 = Compressor ON
 1-19 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system switched on, all requirements met;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOverpressure\L\S\K\I - coolant pressure too high: p \L\S\K\N&gt;\L\S\K\I 32 bar;\L\S\K\A
 2\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower\L\S\K\I - Blower faulty and actual voltage &lt; 3 V;\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVacuum pressure\L\S\K\I - Coolant pressure too low, threshold dependent on the outside temperature,
 outside temperature p \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 2 bar;\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - ECON mode;\L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C OFF\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutside temperature\L\S\K\I - Outside temperature too low, outside temperature \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 3.0°C;\L\S\K\A
 9\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower off\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IUndervoltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle voltage too low, V (term. 15) &lt; 10.1 V;\L\S\K\A
 11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine temperature indicator lamp off\L\S\K\I - Engine temperature &gt; 118°C;\L\S\K\A
 12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ISwitch off engine control module\L\S\K\I - Reason, e.g., engine temperature, coolant fan control module, kick-down (info. via CAN);\L\S\K\A
 13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IExcessive voltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle system voltage too high, V (term. 15) &gt; 17 V;\L\S\K\A
 14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature icing danger\L\S\K\I - Evaporator temperature too low;\L\S\K\A
 16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor activation\L\S\K\I - Malfunction in activation path, e.g. open circuit/ short circuit to B+;\L\S\K\A
 17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no or implausible signal from pressure sensor (PWM signal);\L\S\K\A
 18\L\B\K\I - \L\S\K\ASpeed shut-off
 19\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICut-off via vehicle electrical system control module;</Meldungstext>
